---
description: Sinhala full female name: ge name, given name, surname — රත්නායක මුදියන්සේලාගේ නිලන්ති කුමාරි. THE SURNAME IS IDENTICAL IN FORM TO A MAN'S: Sinhala surnames do not inflect for gender, so this generator draws si.person.lastName, the same file the male generator draws, and there is no person/female/lastName.txt to draw instead. The ge name is likewise the father's house, unchanged by the bearer's sex.
locale: si
generator: tdc
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="g" type="template" value="si.person.geName"/>
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="si.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="si.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.g}} ${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
